    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d514">

                <pb facs="0508" n="432" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg432"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 761.94/98</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to Ambassador Guthrie
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-07-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 8, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your July 7, midnight. Department deeply interested, and awaits for its
                    confidential information detailed report by mail showing Embassy’s
                    interpretation of treaty. Any further statements Foreign Office may issue
                    defining the purpose, scope and intent of treaty should be telegraphed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
